      "html": "<article class=\"vx-card\"><h2>1 先冻结批次和评价规则</h2><p>12批次用于拟合；4批次只用于选择20–50 kJ/mol网格中的Ea；8批次共72个压碎强度点留到最后评分。整批划分避免同一试样的相邻时刻同时落入训练与测试。</p><h2>2 把温度历史积成等效龄期</h2><p>tₑ = ∫ exp[−Ea/R·(1/T−1/Tref)]dt。Ea是表观活化能，描述反应速率对温度的敏感程度；控件以kJ/mol输入，计算时先乘1000转为J/mol，与R=8.314 J/(mol·K)保持一致。T用K，Tref=323.15 K（50°C）。使用相邻温度点的梯形积分；tₑ的单位仍是h。</p></article><section class=\"ct-widget\" data-concept-scene=\"s17x-c1-cement-woc-strength\" data-concept-part=\"workflow\"><h3>用训练点拟合，用独立验证批次选温敏参数</h3><p>本例要求强度随反应进度不下降。把测量波动造成的相邻下降读数合并，按读数数量加权平均，反复合并直到不再下降；这称为相邻违序合并算法（PAVA）单调回归，再在相邻节点间线性插值。横坐标随Ea改变；下面用另外4批验证误差比较候选参数。</p><div class=\"ct-controls\"><label>表观活化能 Ea / kJ·mol⁻¹<select disabled data-ct-key=\"energy\"><option>20</option><option>25</option><option selected>30</option><option>35</option><option>40</option><option>45</option><option>50</option></select></label><label>目标强度 / MPa<input disabled data-ct-key=\"target\" type=\"range\" min=\"1\" max=\"30\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\"></label><button disabled type=\"button\" data-ct-reset>复位本图</button></div><div class=\"ct-chart\" data-ct-graphic><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 880 370\" width=\"880\" height=\"370\" style=\"min-width:880px;width:100%;height:auto;max-height:none\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"训练批次等效龄期强度散点与单调拟合\"><rect width=\"880\" height=\"370\" fill=\"#F7F4EF\"/><g fill=\"#352F2D\" font-family=\"system-ui,Microsoft YaHei,sans-serif\" font-size=\"16\"><path d=\"M90 304H848\" stroke=\"#DDD5CB\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"310\" text-anchor=\"end\">0.0</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"331\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M90 237H848\" stroke=\"#DDD5CB\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"243\" text-anchor=\"end\">6.5</text><text x=\"279.5\" y=\"331\" text-anchor=\"middle\">45</text><path d=\"M90 170H848\" stroke=\"#DDD5CB\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"176\" text-anchor=\"end\">13.0</text><text x=\"469\" y=\"331\" text-anchor=\"middle\">90</text><path d=\"M90 103H848\" stroke=\"#DDD5CB\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"109\" text-anchor=\"end\">19.5</text><text x=\"658.5\" y=\"331\" text-anchor=\"middle\">135</text><path d=\"M90 36H848\" stroke=\"#DDD5CB\"/><text x=\"78\" y=\"42\" text-anchor=\"end\">26.0</text><text x=\"848\" y=\"331\" text-anchor=\"middle\">180</text><path d=\"M90 36V304H848\" stroke=\"#6A5C55\" fill=\"none\"/><text x=\"469\" y=\"358\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50°C等效龄期 / h</text><text transform=\"translate(24 170) rotate(-90)\" text-anchor=\"middle\">抗压强度 / MPa</text><path d=\"M90 200.9230769230769H848\" stroke=\"#B08A4A\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><circle cx=\"97.41522572030702\" cy=\"304\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"105.39503911550817\" cy=\"304\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"113.4548610497528\" cy=\"294.57639793659257\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"125.5616223075937\" cy=\"274.71726589567555\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"137.67016592559995\" cy=\"258.537323204021\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"161.887435076217\" cy=\"222.34175628430668\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"186.10470909628611\" cy=\"195.0150857443108\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"210.3219831284253\" cy=\"171.5288207516027\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"234.53925716059442\" cy=\"152.847748942854\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"99.31701412146931\" cy=\"303.1947946876318\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"110.74570370075993\" cy=\"296.304572504659\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"122.49911557224743\" cy=\"274.5050362528\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"140.19912675365345\" cy=\"245.9599775102171\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"157.9064645992733\" cy=\"213.01264378063877\" r=\"3.5\" fill=\"#B08A4A\" opacity=\".55\"/><circle cx=\"193.3218882227916\" cy=\"171.84188963